mily: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">40</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.85pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 151.7pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 26.97pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.85pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.85pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">전자전기</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기계공학</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff1919; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff1919; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">해당전공만 신청가능</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #ff1919; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.7pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.85pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.41pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; WIDTH: 61.14pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt; HEIGHT: 26.97pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.85pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.7pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.41pt\" valign=\"middle\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이음탐방</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">상세내용은 기업별 자료 참조</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">1) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기업탐방에 따른 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">차량</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">보험가입</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">간식 등 제공예정</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">입니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기업탐방일정은 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">“</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">회사소개</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">시설견학</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">채용정보 소개</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">선배와의 대화</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">등</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">”</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">으로 구성되며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">,</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">탐방 후 탐방보고서를 작성하여 제출하시면</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">심사를 거쳐 산업통상자원부장관상 등 시상</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">이 이루어집니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">참가신청은 팀</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(1~4</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">명</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">) </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">또는 개인 신청이 가능하며</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기업탐방을 희망하는 학생은 탐방일 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">3</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">일 전까지 신청</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">해 주십시오</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청처 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">희망이음 프로젝트 홈페이지</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(</span><a href=\"http://www.hopelink.kr/\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">www.hopelink.kr</span></u></a><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">신청 후 버스 탑승지 및 보험가입 안내 별도 연락 예정</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">4) </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">기업탐방을 통한 현장 방문 및 알짜배기 채용정보 공유 그리고 기업탐방 후기보고서 공모전 참여의 기회에 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; WORD-BREAK: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\">※ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">문의 </span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림\">경북테크노파크 기업지원단 김영민 주임</span><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">(053-819-3053, </span><a href=\"mailto:ymkim@gbtp.or.kr\"><u style=\"text-underline: #0000ff single\"><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; COLOR: #0000ff; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">ymkim@gbtp.or.kr</span></u></a><span style=\"LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">)</span></p><p style=\"LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: both; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt 0.0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
